{
  "description": "The band club's contest day: all of MASTER/SUI_CON.BIN (85 strings; MASTER.EXN, base 0x801E8000; game-internals 6ad). Verified in DuckStation on forced contest days (force_event.py 0 0 --type T --club C, hidden emulator; docs/testing.md 'Club contests'): 0x27, club 5 (Band): the international band contest, the player's lines and the walk home. Checked only statically: the other results (each contest has win and loss texts) and the girls' congratulations.",
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "file": "CDROM/MASTER/SUI_CON.BIN",
      "base": "0x801e8000",
      "share_identical": true,
      "lines": [
        {
          "offset": "0x0",
          "original": "クラブの皆で頑張った吹奏\n楽が、国際吹奏楽コンクー\nルで見事優勝した。",
          "text": "Our club's hard work\npaid off: we won the\nIntl. Band Contest!"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x48",
          "original": "吹奏楽部で３年間頑張った\n成果が出たぜ。",
          "text": "Three years in the band\nreally paid off."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x70",
          "original": "これで、\n音楽家への道が開けたぜ。",
          "text": "Now the road to\nbeing a musician is open."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0xa0",
          "original": "頑張った甲斐があったぜ。",
          "text": "It was worth the effort."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0xc0",
          "original": "…。\n変な髪型。",
          "text": "...\nWeird hairdo."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0xd4",
          "original": "あの娘、\n学校でもぶつかるよな。",
          "text": "That girl's always\nbumping into me at school."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0xf8",
          "original": "待たないよ。",
          "text": "I won't wait."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x10c",
          "original": "{G}、どうかしたの？",
          "text": "What's wrong, {G}?"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x120",
          "original": "私達…\n優勝しちゃったのよね。",
          "text": "We...\nreally won, didn't we?"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x140",
          "original": "うん、優勝しちゃった。",
          "text": "Yeah, we won."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x158",
          "original": "すごいね…。夢みたい。",
          "text": "Amazing... Like a dream."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x184",
          "original": "あっ、{P}。",
          "text": "Oh, {P}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x194",
          "original": "あっ、{G}。",
          "text": "Oh, {G}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x1a0",
          "original": "国際吹奏楽コンクール優勝、\nおめでとう。\nいい演奏だったわ。",
          "text": "Congrats on winning\nthe Band Contest.\nYou played well."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x1dc",
          "original": "そう？ありがとう。",
          "text": "Yeah? Thanks."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x1f0",
          "original": "すごいね…。夢みたい。",
          "text": "Amazing... Like a dream."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x218",
          "original": "あっ、{P}。",
          "text": "Oh, {P}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x228",
          "original": "あっ、{G}。",
          "text": "Oh, {G}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x234",
          "original": "国際吹奏楽コンクール優勝、\nおめでとうございます。\n素晴らしい演奏でした。",
          "text": "Congratulations on\nwinning the Band Contest.\nWhat a great performance."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x280",
          "original": "ありがとう。",
          "text": "Thanks."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x290",
          "original": "すごいですね…\n感動しました。",
          "text": "That's amazing...\nI was so moved."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x2c0",
          "original": "あっ、{P}。",
          "text": "Oh, {P}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x2d0",
          "original": "あっ、{G}。",
          "text": "Oh, {G}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x2dc",
          "original": "国際吹奏楽コンクールで\n優勝したわね。",
          "text": "So you won the\nBand Contest."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x304",
          "original": "聞いてくれたの？\nどうだった？",
          "text": "You listened?\nHow was it?"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x324",
          "original": "くだらないけど、\n他人より優れているのは\nいいことよ。",
          "text": "It's foolish, but\nbeing better than\nothers is good."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x36c",
          "original": "私達が優勝したなんて…\nなんだか夢みたいね。",
          "text": "Us, winning...\nIt's like a dream."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x398",
          "original": "ははは、そうだね。",
          "text": "Haha, it sure is."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x3ac",
          "original": "優勝したのよねぇ…。",
          "text": "We won, didn't we..."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x3c4",
          "original": "しちゃったんだよね。",
          "text": "We sure did."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x3f4",
          "original": "ハーイ、{P}。",
          "text": "Hi there, {P}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x404",
          "original": "あっ、{G}。",
          "text": "Oh, {G}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x410",
          "original": "国際吹奏楽コンクール優勝、\nおめでとう。\n聞いてたわよ。",
          "text": "Congrats on winning\nthe Band Contest.\nI heard you play."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x448",
          "original": "ありがとう。どうだった？",
          "text": "Thanks. How was it?"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x464",
          "original": "ワンダフル、\n素晴らしかったわ。",
          "text": "Wonderful,\nit was marvelous."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x494",
          "original": "あっ、{P}。",
          "text": "Oh, {P}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x4a4",
          "original": "あっ、{G}。",
          "text": "Oh, {G}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x4b0",
          "original": "国際吹奏楽コンクール優勝、\nおめでとう。\n聞いてたよ。",
          "text": "Congrats on winning\nthe Band Contest.\nI heard you play."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x4e8",
          "original": "ありがとう。\nどうだった？",
          "text": "Thanks.\nHow was it?"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x504",
          "original": "すごく良かったよ。\n私でも感動したから。",
          "text": "It was really good.\nEven I was moved."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x53c",
          "original": "こんにちは\n{P}。",
          "text": "Good afternoon,\n{P}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x550",
          "original": "あっ、{G}。",
          "text": "Oh, {G}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x55c",
          "original": "この度は、なにか大きな賞\nをいただいたそうで、\nおめでとうございます。",
          "text": "I heard you won\na major award.\nCongratulations!"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x5a4",
          "original": "ははは、\n国際吹奏楽コンクールで\n優勝したんだよ。",
          "text": "Hahaha,\nwe won the International\nBand Contest."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x5d8",
          "original": "国際…長いですねぇ",
          "text": "What a long name!"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x5ec",
          "original": "そ、そう？",
          "text": "R-really?"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x60c",
          "original": "あっ、{P}。",
          "text": "Oh, {P}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x61c",
          "original": "あっ、{G}。",
          "text": "Oh, {G}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x628",
          "original": "国際吹奏楽コンクール優勝、\nおめでとう。\n聞いてたよ。",
          "text": "Congrats on winning\nthe Band Contest.\nI heard you play."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x660",
          "original": "ありがとう。\nどうだった？",
          "text": "Thanks.\nHow was it?"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x67c",
          "original": "うまく言えないけど…\nすごく素敵だった。",
          "text": "I can't quite explain it...\nIt was wonderful."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x6b4",
          "original": "あっ、{P}。",
          "text": "Oh, {P}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x6c4",
          "original": "あっ、{G}。",
          "text": "Oh, {G}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x6d0",
          "original": "国際吹奏楽コンクール、\n優勝おめでとう。",
          "text": "Congrats on winning\nthe Band Contest."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x6f8",
          "original": "ありがとう。",
          "text": "Thanks."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x708",
          "original": "あなたが受賞するのは、\n悪い気分じゃないわね。",
          "text": "Seeing you win doesn't\nfeel half bad."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x74c",
          "original": "あっ、{P}。",
          "text": "Oh, {P}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x75c",
          "original": "あっ、{G}。",
          "text": "Oh, {G}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x768",
          "original": "国際吹奏楽コンクール優勝、\nおめでとう。",
          "text": "Congrats on winning\nthe Band Contest."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x790",
          "original": "ありがとう。",
          "text": "Thanks."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x7a0",
          "original": "これであなたも有名人だね。",
          "text": "Now you're famous!"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x7cc",
          "original": "あっ、{P}。",
          "text": "Oh, {P}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x7dc",
          "original": "あっ、{G}。",
          "text": "Oh, {G}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x7e8",
          "original": "あの…\n国際吹奏楽コンクール、\n優勝おめでとうございます。\nすごく素敵でした。",
          "text": "Um...\ncongratulations on\nwinning the Band Contest.\nIt was wonderful."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x834",
          "original": "ありがとう、{G}。\n聞いててくれたんだ。",
          "text": "Thanks, {G}\nYou were listening."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x85c",
          "original": "は、はい…。",
          "text": "Y-yes..."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x87c",
          "original": "あっ、{P}。",
          "text": "Oh, {P}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x88c",
          "original": "あっ、{G}。",
          "text": "Oh, {G}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x898",
          "original": "国際吹奏楽コンクール優勝、\nおめでとうございます。",
          "text": "Congratulations on\nwinning the Band Contest!"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x8cc",
          "original": "ありがとう、{G}。",
          "text": "Thanks, {G}."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x8dc",
          "original": "優美、\n友達に自慢しちゃうんだー。",
          "text": "Yumi's gonna brag\nto her friends!"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x910",
          "original": "\n　　　　　　　　ドン",
          "text": "\n                Bump"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x928",
          "original": "いてっ。",
          "text": "Ow!"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x93c",
          "original": "{-謎の女}あっ、ごめんなさい。",
          "text": "{-Girl}Oh, I'm sorry."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x958",
          "original": "えっと…？",
          "text": "Um...?"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x964",
          "original": "{-謎の女}あっ、天才音楽家の…。",
          "text": "{-Girl}Oh, the genius musician..."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x984",
          "original": "えっ？\n（俺のこと？）",
          "text": "Huh?\n(Me?)"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x99c",
          "original": "{-謎の女}本当に、ごめんなさい。\nそれじゃ…。",
          "text": "{-Girl}I'm so sorry.\nBye..."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x9dc",
          "original": "やあ、おはよう。",
          "text": "Ah, good morning."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x9f4",
          "original": "い、{G}。\nなんでこんなところに。",
          "text": "I-{G}.\nWhy are you here?"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0xa14",
          "original": "いやなに、君が\n国際吹奏楽コンクールで\n優勝したというので、\n本当かどうか確かめに…。",
          "text": "Oh, I heard\nyou'd won the\nBand Contest, so I\ncame to see if it's true..."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0xa68",
          "original": "………。\nおまえも暇だな。\nじゃあな、伊集院。",
          "text": "......\nNothing better to do, huh?\nSee you, Ijuin."
        },
        {
          "offset": "0xa98",
          "original": "あっ、待ちたまえ！",
          "text": "Ah, wait!"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x169c",
          "original": "{G}？",
          "text": "{G}?"
        },
        {
          "offset": "0x16a0",
          "original": "そう？",
          "text": "Oh?"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
